@JIITPlacement_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104
@admin_token = paste_token_from_login_response_here

### Public job APIs (consumed by the frontend)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Accept: application/json

### Admin login (password comes from Admin:Password config/env — never committed)
POST {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin@jiit",
  "password": "your_admin_password"
}

### Job count (authenticated)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/count
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Sync offered students onto the Jobs table (authenticated; idempotent)
POST {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/sync-offer-students
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Students placed against one job (authenticated)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/{job_id}/placed-students
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Company-wise placement rollup (public - dashboard Link 2)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/placements/company-wise?page=1&pageSize=20&search=
Accept: application/json

### Placed students for one job (public - dashboard Link 2 detail)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/placements/jobs/{job_id}/placed-students
Accept: application/json

### Gmail notices - excludes congratulation / final-offer data (public - dashboard Link 3)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/notices/email?page=1&pageSize=20&search=&type=
Accept: application/json

### Superset notices (public - dashboard Link 4)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/notices?page=1&pageSize=20&search=
Accept: application/json

### Start sync (authenticated; 409 when a sync is already running)
POST {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Sync status / final result (authenticated)
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/sync/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete every job + its stored documents (authenticated; 409 while a sync runs)
DELETE {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Logout — revokes the token's jti immediately (authenticated)
POST {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Unauthorized check — must return {"success":false,"message":"Unauthorized"}
GET {{JIITPlacement_HostAddress}}/api/admin/jobs/count
Accept: application/json

###
